# DOOM1.WAD E1M1: from the start, turn west and run into the start room's
# south-west diagonal wall, sliding along it to the west wall; turn round,
# run east along the room's south side to its east wall, then strafe left
# (north) along it, pressed into it, and down into the pit.
iwad doom1
0 0 64 0
50 0 0 0 x40
0 0 64 0 x2
50 0 0 0 x50
50 -40 0 0 x20
0 0 0 0 x10
